        "title_size": "h2",
        "description": "<p><strong>👩‍🏫 Facilitators:</strong></p><ul><li><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/drtimlucas/\" target=\"_blank\">Tim Lucas</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/sabryna-alsfasser/\" target=\"_blank\">Sabryna Alsfasser</a></li></ul><p><strong>🕔 Duration: </strong>45–60 minutes (live online)</p><p><strong>📍 Format:</strong> Ondemand Webinar.</p><p></p><p><strong>You’ll explore:</strong></p><ul><li>checkWhy foresight is a practical leadership discipline in uncertainty (resilience and adaptability &gt; prediction).</li><li>checkHow to use AI to surface assumptions, widen perspectives, and explore consequences. A hands-on method for “critical thinking with AI” using \"Flip the Future\".</li><li>checkHow Hyper Island \"Futures Agent\" can accelerate sensing, scenario exploration, and strategic optioning.</li></ul><p></p><p><strong>Who it’s for:</strong></p><ul><li>checkStrategy, innovation, transformation, and people leaders.</li><li>checkTeams experimenting with AI pilots and struggling to translate them into durable value.</li><li>checkIndividuals curious about applying AI beyond productivity hacks.</li></ul>",
